 "text": "Press Alt+1 for screen-reader mode, Alt+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window D3 Meet Us Services Our Work Blog Careers Contact Us REQUEST A QUOTE Search Results 52 Results Smarter Marketing For AI: Strategies That Work AI is changing how customers find businesses. Instead of scrolling search results, people are asking questions and expecting direct answers. “What can we do right now to make our business show up as an answer in AI?” That was one of the most asked questions during D3’s AI Series. As a digital marketing company experiencing... How an AI Assistant Can Turn Website Visitors into Leads Imagine being able to guide every visitor through your website, especially those who don’t know exactly what they want or how to find it. A custom AI Assistant can help to bridge that gap and retain your visitors. This tool quickly answers questions, provides an overview of your services, and helps to convert those visitors... When It’s Time to Redesign Your Website “How do I know when it is time to redesign my website?” is one of the most common questions we hear from business owners. An outdated website can cost you visibility, trust, and leads. Having been in the digital marketing business for 30 years, D3 knows one thing for certain: evolution is expected. Your customers... Five Reasons Pay-Per-Click Ads Generate Business Wondering if pay-per-click advertising still matters as the world dives deeper into AI, ChatGPT, and other Answer Engines? According to DemandSage, businesses make an average of $2 in revenue for every $1 spent on Google Ads, and 63% of consumers click on paid digital ads when they intend to buy a product online. Pay-Per-Click (PPC)... Retargeting 101: How to Remarket Your Brand In today’s competitive, crowded, and privacy-first digital environment, retargeting is essential in helping your brand reconnect with users who have already shown interest. It’s one of the most powerful ways to reconnect with visitors to your site and make the most out of every marketing dollar. The truth is, most people will not convert the... Google Ads or Meta? Here’s What We Tell Clients Are you ready to take your advertising to the next level, but are unsure of where to begin? When D3 meets with business owners and decision makers, one of the first questions that comes up is, “Should we run Google or Meta/Facebook ads?” And the answer isn’t always as simple as you’d think. The two... Are You Writing for AI, or Letting AI Write for You? We get it, artificial intelligence is everywhere. It’s streamlining everyday tasks, saving time, and even producing a decent return with the right prompts. So, when you’re busy juggling hundreds of other responsibilities, it’s tempting to let AI take the reins on your website content. The truth is, letting AI handle all of your content may... SEO & Social: When Worlds Collide In digital marketing, SEO and social media are often placed in separate silos. SEO is known for playing the long game. Think keywords, technical tweaks, and content that builds momentum over time. Social media, on the other hand, is quick-moving, community-focused, and harvesting real-time connections. But here’s the thing: when you stop treating them like... Are You Breaking Up the Brand Again? At D3, we see it all the time—businesses unintentionally chipping away at their brand and watering down hard-earned recognition and trust with inconsistent visuals, off-brand messaging, or poor-quality content. The good news? With the right approach (and a little support from our team), you can protect your brand every time you click “publish”. Keeping Your... Crisis Communication Pepsi, Facebook, Toyota, Chipotle. We have witnessed... Subscribe Get the latest marketing news and advice. First Name Last Name Email SUBSCRIBE This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. 12319 Ocean Gateway, Suite 202 Ocean City, Maryland 21842 410-213-2400 212 West Main Street Salisbury, Maryland 21801 Meet Us Testimonials Services Case Studies Videos ID3AS Blog Careers Contact Us Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions Webmail Accessibility Site Map Copyright © 2026 D3. All Rights Reserved. Website Design by D3, Ocean City MD Our Partners PREVIOUS Google YouTube Shopify Amazon Adobe Woocommerce Wordpress Bing Facebook Google YouTube Shopify Amazon Adobe Woocommerce Wordpress Bing Facebook Google NEXT",
